{"code": 200, "name": "baidu", "title": "百度", "type": "热搜", "params": {"type": {"name": "热搜类别", "type": {"realtime": "热搜", "novel": "小说", "movie": "电影", "teleplay": "电视剧", "car": "汽车", "game": "游戏"}}}, "link": "https://top.baidu.com/board", "total": 30, "fromCache": true, "updateTime": "2026-09-22T00:01:21.694Z", "data": [{"id": 0, "title": "习近平复信美国10所高校青年学生", "desc": "近日，国家主席习近平复信来华参加中美青年主题交流活动的美国10所高校青年学生。习近平指出，很高兴得知大家在中国经历了一段愉快难忘的旅程。你们在来信中表达了对中华文明的喜爱，对中美两国友好合作的期待，表示愿做跨越太平洋的友谊使者，我对此感到欣慰。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/23498e790ec72673a3e3ee478372308e", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7904114, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B9%A0%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E5%A4%8D%E4%BF%A1%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD10%E6%89%80%E9%AB%98%E6%A0%A1%E9%9D%92%E5%B9%B4%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B9%A0%E8%BF%91%E5%B9%B3%E5%A4%8D%E4%BF%A1%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD10%E6%89%80%E9%AB%98%E6%A0%A1%E9%9D%92%E5%B9%B4%E5%AD%A6%E7%94%9F"}, {"id": 0, "title": "多地禁产“老头乐”", "desc": "近日，江苏徐州和鲁西南部分地区厂家已被限制生产低速电动四轮车。受此影响，有座椅配件厂订单减少三分之一，保险杠厂订单下降20%至30%。此前，各地多从使用层面限制“老头乐”上路。随着部分地区过渡期到期，全面禁行与禁产政策接连落地，低速四轮车市场空间被压缩。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/7588f2ad14d7f4b31b431b3e27dff877", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7809543, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A4%9A%E5%9C%B0%E7%A6%81%E4%BA%A7%E2%80%9C%E8%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E4%B9%90%E2%80%9D", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A4%9A%E5%9C%B0%E7%A6%81%E4%BA%A7%E2%80%9C%E8%80%81%E5%A4%B4%E4%B9%90%E2%80%9D"}, {"id": 1, "title": "雷军回应“打新宇树赚了100多亿”", "desc": "9月21日，雷军在直播中澄清网传“打新宇树科技赚了100多亿”传闻。他回应称，该投资并非其个人投资而是顺为投资；也并非打新，而是支持早期创业者的天使投资。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/db04a1b21500cfc2565018d83017c38b", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7712623, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%9B%B7%E5%86%9B%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94%E2%80%9C%E6%89%93%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%87%E6%A0%91%E8%B5%9A%E4%BA%86100%E5%A4%9A%E4%BA%BF%E2%80%9D", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%9B%B7%E5%86%9B%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94%E2%80%9C%E6%89%93%E6%96%B0%E5%AE%87%E6%A0%91%E8%B5%9A%E4%BA%86100%E5%A4%9A%E4%BA%BF%E2%80%9D"}, {"id": 2, "title": "商品消费扩容升级的三重机制", "desc": "日前，商务部等7部门发布《关于推动商品消费扩容升级的实施意见》，提出到2030年社会消费品零售总额达60万亿元左右。专家指出，该文件构建三重机制：通过供给侧创新创造有效需求，以结构分层拓展空间，并通过制度供给降低交易成本。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/ee8dd7a20d04293bd7266a7f752f6965", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7618722, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E6%89%A9%E5%AE%B9%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E6%89%A9%E5%AE%B9%E5%8D%87%E7%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%89%E9%87%8D%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6"}, {"id": 3, "title": "潘展乐称张展硕是奇迹之子", "desc": "9月21日，亚运会男子游泳接力决赛，中国队逆转日本队夺冠。赛后，潘展乐打趣称张展硕是“奇迹之子”，并自嘲“最菜”所以游第三棒。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/01bbf699ee51d33acd1c5cb617f45aba", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7523260, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%BD%98%E5%B1%95%E4%B9%90%E7%A7%B0%E5%BC%A0%E5%B1%95%E7%A1%95%E6%98%AF%E5%A5%87%E8%BF%B9%E4%B9%8B%E5%AD%90", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%BD%98%E5%B1%95%E4%B9%90%E7%A7%B0%E5%BC%A0%E5%B1%95%E7%A1%95%E6%98%AF%E5%A5%87%E8%BF%B9%E4%B9%8B%E5%AD%90"}, {"id": 4, "title": "纳指涨近600点 Meta涨超11%", "desc": "北京时间9月22日，美股三大股指全线收涨，纳指涨近600点创近4个月收盘新高。科技股全线收涨，Meta涨超11%，其AI助手取代ChatGPT成美iOS最受欢迎免费应用。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/2b009f0adb22916d6d0e93a66c690454", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7424581, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BA%B3%E6%8C%87%E6%B6%A8%E8%BF%91600%E7%82%B9%20Meta%E6%B6%A8%E8%B6%8511%25", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BA%B3%E6%8C%87%E6%B6%A8%E8%BF%91600%E7%82%B9+Meta%E6%B6%A8%E8%B6%8511%25"}, {"id": 5, "title": "多地宣布结婚发钱", "desc": "我国多地陆续推出婚育激励举措，部分市县、村居针对符合条件的初婚夫妻，发放现金红包或结婚消费券。山西吕梁、福建明溪、广东部分村镇均出台相关奖励政策，部分企业也给结婚员工发放奖金，以此鼓励适龄婚育，减轻新人婚恋相关开销压力。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/7a9e5aa6eb60ca9398017be4c4c77bd2", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7328374, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A4%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E7%BB%93%E5%A9%9A%E5%8F%91%E9%92%B1", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A4%9A%E5%9C%B0%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%83%E7%BB%93%E5%A9%9A%E5%8F%91%E9%92%B1"}, {"id": 6, "title": "“北京的Luke”让台湾粉丝上头了", "desc": "近日，大陆剧《早春晴朗》在台湾岛内掀起追剧热潮。此前，近年大陆文艺作品频频在台湾圈粉，两岸艺术交流亦呈“双向奔赴”之势。这份同频，背后既有大陆文化软实力的提升，也有大陆流媒体平台的密集“出海”，更源自两岸文化的根脉相通。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/9fcdb119ba78a32ba42ebd75d795afc1", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7234793, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%9A%84Luke%E2%80%9D%E8%AE%A9%E5%8F%B0%E6%B9%BE%E7%B2%89%E4%B8%9D%E4%B8%8A%E5%A4%B4%E4%BA%86", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E2%80%9C%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%9A%84Luke%E2%80%9D%E8%AE%A9%E5%8F%B0%E6%B9%BE%E7%B2%89%E4%B8%9D%E4%B8%8A%E5%A4%B4%E4%BA%86"}, {"id": 7, "title": "Muse登上苹果应用商店榜首", "desc": "21日，受旗下AI助手Muse登顶美国苹果和谷歌应用商店免费榜首位提振，Meta股价收涨11%，盘中一度涨13%。分析师指出，这表明Meta大规模AI投资正逐步转化为商业回报。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/f1cfcb23086e287473d821e016ce7a7b", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7139609, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=Muse%E7%99%BB%E4%B8%8A%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9C%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E5%95%86%E5%BA%97%E6%A6%9C%E9%A6%96", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=Muse%E7%99%BB%E4%B8%8A%E8%8B%B9%E6%9E%9C%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E5%95%86%E5%BA%97%E6%A6%9C%E9%A6%96"}, {"id": 8, "title": "豪华燃油车集体“腰斩式”降价", "desc": "目前，豪华燃油车集体出现“腰斩式”降价。沃尔沃S90降幅逼近50%，路虎卫士直降超17万，奥迪A6L裸车低至26万，宝马5系跌破29万。二线豪车跌至15万级，一线BBA价格大幅缩水，豪华车溢价神话彻底破灭。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/d789d732efc91e3235d26056c4b72566", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 7044663, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%B1%AA%E5%8D%8E%E7%87%83%E6%B2%B9%E8%BD%A6%E9%9B%86%E4%BD%93%E2%80%9C%E8%85%B0%E6%96%A9%E5%BC%8F%E2%80%9D%E9%99%8D%E4%BB%B7", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%B1%AA%E5%8D%8E%E7%87%83%E6%B2%B9%E8%BD%A6%E9%9B%86%E4%BD%93%E2%80%9C%E8%85%B0%E6%96%A9%E5%BC%8F%E2%80%9D%E9%99%8D%E4%BB%B7"}, {"id": 9, "title": "深圳市委：坚决拥护党中央决定", "desc": "9月21日晚，深圳市委常委会召开会议，通报覃伟中涉嫌严重违纪违法、接受中央纪委国家监委纪律审查和监察调查有关情况。市委书记靳磊主持会议并讲话。与会同志一致表示，坚决拥护党中央决定，坚决拥护中央纪委国家监委决定。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/3d8738cb1f51a1f3d4da075d8579ae00", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6952531, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%B8%82%E5%A7%94%EF%BC%9A%E5%9D%9A%E5%86%B3%E6%8B%A5%E6%8A%A4%E5%85%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%B3%E5%B8%82%E5%A7%94%EF%BC%9A%E5%9D%9A%E5%86%B3%E6%8B%A5%E6%8A%A4%E5%85%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A"}, {"id": 10, "title": "青海辟谣前文旅厅厅长开网约车", "desc": "近日，网民分享西宁网约车司机讲解青海行政区划、民族特色、地域文化等知识的视频后，网络平台开始流传该司机“是青海前文旅厅厅长”“能上能下，自食其力”等不实言论。经核实，视频中的司机为西宁本地网约车从业人员白师傅，从事网约车行业已有11年。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/c3e75fd9a21305bd46bf1e7d27689318", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6848444, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%9D%92%E6%B5%B7%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%87%E6%97%85%E5%8E%85%E5%8E%85%E9%95%BF%E5%BC%80%E7%BD%91%E7%BA%A6%E8%BD%A6", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%9D%92%E6%B5%B7%E8%BE%9F%E8%B0%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%87%E6%97%85%E5%8E%85%E5%8E%85%E9%95%BF%E5%BC%80%E7%BD%91%E7%BA%A6%E8%BD%A6"}, {"id": 11, "title": "潘展乐 我最菜所以我第三棒", "desc": "潘展乐在解释接力排棒原因时表示，队友因是单项冠军且手最长、总能创造奇迹，被安排在最后一棒；前两棒按水平排序，自己因实力最“菜”被安排在第三棒。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/d8f7d121e1f346b159a31a3d9ce663e9", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6762097, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%BD%98%E5%B1%95%E4%B9%90%20%E6%88%91%E6%9C%80%E8%8F%9C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E6%88%91%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%A3%92", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%BD%98%E5%B1%95%E4%B9%90+%E6%88%91%E6%9C%80%E8%8F%9C%E6%89%80%E4%BB%A5%E6%88%91%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%A3%92"}, {"id": 12, "title": "央视起底绵羊绒实为绵羊毛", "desc": "近日，央视起底河北省清河县“绵羊绒”造假乱象。在记者追问下，有商家承认所谓“100%绵羊绒”实为绵羊毛，甚至有化纤原料也被冠以该名义销售。专家指出，山羊原绒与绵羊毛原料价差高达10倍以上。部分利益相关方强行制造“绵羊绒”概念，混淆视听误导消费者。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/fa50d175202c27cb1b8451bcc0d3645e", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6666659, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A4%AE%E8%A7%86%E8%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E7%BB%B5%E7%BE%8A%E7%BB%92%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%B5%E7%BE%8A%E6%AF%9B", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A4%AE%E8%A7%86%E8%B5%B7%E5%BA%95%E7%BB%B5%E7%BE%8A%E7%BB%92%E5%AE%9E%E4%B8%BA%E7%BB%B5%E7%BE%8A%E6%AF%9B"}, {"id": 13, "title": "上海一居民家阳台惊现白化蟒蛇", "desc": "9月19日，上海宝山区大场镇真华路一居民阳台惊现一条长约3米、重约30斤的缅甸蟒蛇。视频显示巨蛇正吐着信子游走，吓晕众多网友。随后消防员赶到，用麻袋将其装入，并移交野生动物保护管理站。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/8d2acbe99a2c1fc6109364534bd43571", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6564012, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E4%B8%80%E5%B1%85%E6%B0%91%E5%AE%B6%E9%98%B3%E5%8F%B0%E6%83%8A%E7%8E%B0%E7%99%BD%E5%8C%96%E8%9F%92%E8%9B%87", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E4%B8%80%E5%B1%85%E6%B0%91%E5%AE%B6%E9%98%B3%E5%8F%B0%E6%83%8A%E7%8E%B0%E7%99%BD%E5%8C%96%E8%9F%92%E8%9B%87"}, {"id": 14, "title": "女子马来西亚旅游遭男子闯入脱衣", "desc": "9月19日晚，马来西亚警方在仙本那一度假村抓获一名18岁男子。此前一名25岁中国女游客在仙本那睡觉时遭陌生男子闯入房间并脱去部分衣服。女子反抗后骗其先去洗澡，并趁机逃出藏身灌木丛至早晨被发现。目前，中国驻哥打基纳巴卢总领馆正跟进案件处置进展。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/a5ed379ce395b487066d5dc9890325ee", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6463602, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E9%A9%AC%E6%9D%A5%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%9A%E6%97%85%E6%B8%B8%E9%81%AD%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%90%E9%97%AF%E5%85%A5%E8%84%B1%E8%A1%A3", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E9%A9%AC%E6%9D%A5%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%9A%E6%97%85%E6%B8%B8%E9%81%AD%E7%94%B7%E5%AD%90%E9%97%AF%E5%85%A5%E8%84%B1%E8%A1%A3"}, {"id": 15, "title": "美股半导体股深夜飙涨", "desc": "北京时间9月21日晚，美股三大指数集体上涨。半导体板块大涨，费城半导体指数涨超2%，ARM大涨超12%，芯片巨头AMD涨超8%，创下历史新高，总市值超9900亿美元。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/c983a439fe22dc03596ddb1fbb0ad0a6", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6373965, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1%E5%8D%8A%E5%AF%BC%E4%BD%93%E8%82%A1%E6%B7%B1%E5%A4%9C%E9%A3%99%E6%B6%A8", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1%E5%8D%8A%E5%AF%BC%E4%BD%93%E8%82%A1%E6%B7%B1%E5%A4%9C%E9%A3%99%E6%B6%A8"}, {"id": 16, "title": "16岁少年与14岁女孩发生关系获刑3年", "desc": "据悉，山东16岁小伙常某被指与一名14岁的初中女生发生性关系，法院认定强奸罪成立，判处有期徒刑三年。但常某家属认为双方系恋爱关系，属自愿行为，不应构成强奸罪。9月21日，常某家属称其申诉被法院驳回。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/5c9847a4854f1e0d28817f913d6b68bc", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6280168, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=16%E5%B2%81%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%8E14%E5%B2%81%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%A9%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E8%8E%B7%E5%88%913%E5%B9%B4", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=16%E5%B2%81%E5%B0%91%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%8E14%E5%B2%81%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%A9%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%85%B3%E7%B3%BB%E8%8E%B7%E5%88%913%E5%B9%B4"}, {"id": 17, "title": "旧手机怎么处理最安全", "desc": "旧手机怎么处理最安全？吉林民警提醒，仅格式化或恢复出厂无法彻底清除旧手机数据，信息仍可被技术恢复。建议恢复出厂后用大文件填满手机，覆盖原有数据，再重置一次。即便不法分子恢复数据，拿到的也只是一堆影视文件。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/5c318457ccefc22c35e0a33fe0c88ed9", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6181840, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%97%A7%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%9C%80%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%97%A7%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%9C%80%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8"}, {"id": 18, "title": "花钱就能背书 揭开“中食办”真相", "desc": "近日，记者起底“中国安全食品培优孵化系统工程办公室”（简称“中食办”）发现，其无登记信息，涉嫌非法组织。此前，自2015年起该组织在多地活动，曾到山东阳谷县向企业收费发证进行食品背书。中国轻工业联合会等已声明与其无关。专家指其涉嫌诈骗等刑事犯罪。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/8aff8b49f9fb7463aa5fb67d04eca763", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 6086604, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%8A%B1%E9%92%B1%E5%B0%B1%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E4%B9%A6%20%E6%8F%AD%E5%BC%80%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%AD%E9%A3%9F%E5%8A%9E%E2%80%9D%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B8", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%8A%B1%E9%92%B1%E5%B0%B1%E8%83%BD%E8%83%8C%E4%B9%A6+%E6%8F%AD%E5%BC%80%E2%80%9C%E4%B8%AD%E9%A3%9F%E5%8A%9E%E2%80%9D%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B8"}, {"id": 19, "title": "柬埔寨“8号电诈园区”内部曝光", "desc": "当地时间9月21日，柬埔寨当局带领媒体实地走访“8号电诈园区”。园区占地约120公顷，可容纳约2万人，办公、住宿、餐饮等设施一应俱全，俨然一座相对独立的“城中城”。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/cb00b659c21f72cbf77b7e28ef6d3f44", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5984594, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%9F%AC%E5%9F%94%E5%AF%A8%E2%80%9C8%E5%8F%B7%E7%94%B5%E8%AF%88%E5%9B%AD%E5%8C%BA%E2%80%9D%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E6%9B%9D%E5%85%89", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E6%9F%AC%E5%9F%94%E5%AF%A8%E2%80%9C8%E5%8F%B7%E7%94%B5%E8%AF%88%E5%9B%AD%E5%8C%BA%E2%80%9D%E5%86%85%E9%83%A8%E6%9B%9D%E5%85%89"}, {"id": 20, "title": "中网正赛外卡名单：郑钦文孙心然领衔", "desc": "9月21日，2026中国网球公开赛正赛外卡名单正式揭晓。除此前已公布的郑钦文、孙心然外，女单外卡归属袁悦、朱琳等6人；男单4张外卡由布云朝克特、张之臻、商竣程及勒纳·钱获得。赛事将于9月28日至10月11日在国家网球中心挥拍开赛。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/a056dbaca6567a42d92074704dcd0b55", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5900906, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E7%BD%91%E6%AD%A3%E8%B5%9B%E5%A4%96%E5%8D%A1%E5%90%8D%E5%8D%95%EF%BC%9A%E9%83%91%E9%92%A6%E6%96%87%E5%AD%99%E5%BF%83%E7%84%B6%E9%A2%86%E8%A1%94", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E7%BD%91%E6%AD%A3%E8%B5%9B%E5%A4%96%E5%8D%A1%E5%90%8D%E5%8D%95%EF%BC%9A%E9%83%91%E9%92%A6%E6%96%87%E5%AD%99%E5%BF%83%E7%84%B6%E9%A2%86%E8%A1%94"}, {"id": 21, "title": "iPhone 18系列第一批受害者来了", "desc": "9月21日，针对网友吐槽iPhone 18 Pro系列频繁死机重启，杭州数码市场经营户回应称该情况概率极低，官方渠道可换，授权店激活后不换。此前9月18日该机发售后，国内外多名用户反映在使用Face ID或特定操作时触发死机重启。经营户提醒消费者激活前需仔细验机。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/26931c7938e4023236a9b482031c701b", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5802607, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=iPhone%2018%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%89%B9%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E8%80%85%E6%9D%A5%E4%BA%86", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=iPhone+18%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E6%89%B9%E5%8F%97%E5%AE%B3%E8%80%85%E6%9D%A5%E4%BA%86"}, {"id": 22, "title": "储户约8万存款疑遭盗刷 银行回应", "desc": "9月21日，工行陕西分行就储户8万元存款疑似被盗刷一事作出回应。银行表示，警方开具的无过错证明仅作刑事立案使用，无法直接作为民事赔偿依据，建议储户走诉讼途径。今年1月24日，周先生卡内8万余元被转走，郧西县公安局出具证明，认定储户无过错。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/091fe3cec2626e7059c76f5504af0e15", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5700474, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%82%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%BA%A68%E4%B8%87%E5%AD%98%E6%AC%BE%E7%96%91%E9%81%AD%E7%9B%97%E5%88%B7%20%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%82%A8%E6%88%B7%E7%BA%A68%E4%B8%87%E5%AD%98%E6%AC%BE%E7%96%91%E9%81%AD%E7%9B%97%E5%88%B7+%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%9E%E5%BA%94"}, {"id": 23, "title": "陈建州心梗手术后出院 本人发文道歉", "desc": "9月21日，陈建州发文透露，自己已顺利出院返家休养。他感谢了医疗团队的专业照顾与治疗，同时为日前在社交平台晒出的照片道歉。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/8befd8a25e9a48df3bffee03c3b0a196", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5622405, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%99%88%E5%BB%BA%E5%B7%9E%E5%BF%83%E6%A2%97%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%AF%E5%90%8E%E5%87%BA%E9%99%A2%20%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%91%E6%96%87%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E9%99%88%E5%BB%BA%E5%B7%9E%E5%BF%83%E6%A2%97%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%AF%E5%90%8E%E5%87%BA%E9%99%A2+%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%91%E6%96%87%E9%81%93%E6%AD%89"}, {"id": 24, "title": "观众拼团许愿经典电影重新上映", "desc": "近期，影院创新经营模式推出“拼好片”玩法，观众可在小程序拼团许愿经典电影重映。这轮许愿有近百万网友参与，最终《长安三万里》等6部高分片入选。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/04d9d70388fd76ad48d17fe78e932ae0", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5526003, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%A7%82%E4%BC%97%E6%8B%BC%E5%9B%A2%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E7%94%B5%E5%BD%B1%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%8A%E6%98%A0", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E8%A7%82%E4%BC%97%E6%8B%BC%E5%9B%A2%E8%AE%B8%E6%84%BF%E7%BB%8F%E5%85%B8%E7%94%B5%E5%BD%B1%E9%87%8D%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%8A%E6%98%A0"}, {"id": 25, "title": "妹妹送哥哥入伍上一秒微笑下一秒大哭", "desc": "近日，在安徽马鞍山车站，妹妹送别入伍的哥哥，前一刻还面带微笑，转瞬情绪破防、失声大哭，这一幕令人动容。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/2a1f5073fa511466cff958fa9843ea48", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5430268, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A6%B9%E5%A6%B9%E9%80%81%E5%93%A5%E5%93%A5%E5%85%A5%E4%BC%8D%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%92%E5%BE%AE%E7%AC%91%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%92%E5%A4%A7%E5%93%AD", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%A6%B9%E5%A6%B9%E9%80%81%E5%93%A5%E5%93%A5%E5%85%A5%E4%BC%8D%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%92%E5%BE%AE%E7%AC%91%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E7%A7%92%E5%A4%A7%E5%93%AD"}, {"id": 26, "title": "今年中秋十五的月亮十七圆", "desc": "25日将迎来中秋佳节。今年中秋挺特别，月亮最圆时刻出现在9月27日凌晨0时49分，是少见的“十五的月亮十七圆”。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/360d2b48ea7dbdefb73100f93d7c5cd2", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5318655, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%AD%E7%A7%8B%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%88%E4%BA%AE%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%83%E5%9C%86", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%AD%E7%A7%8B%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%94%E7%9A%84%E6%9C%88%E4%BA%AE%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%83%E5%9C%86"}, {"id": 27, "title": "儿子辞职帮酗酒51年父亲戒酒", "desc": "9月20日，河南王先生的父亲已成功戒酒一年零三个月，目前状态良好。此前，王先生父亲酗酒51年，确诊重度酒精肝。为帮父亲戒酒，王先生毅然辞去工作全职陪伴，最终助其幡然醒悟，重归正常生活。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/d1e8e092bf2cd72dfd4cf489b4e23911", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5241577, "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%84%BF%E5%AD%90%E8%BE%9E%E8%81%8C%E5%B8%AE%E9%85%97%E9%85%9251%E5%B9%B4%E7%88%B6%E4%BA%B2%E6%88%92%E9%85%92", "mobileUrl": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E5%84%BF%E5%AD%90%E8%BE%9E%E8%81%8C%E5%B8%AE%E9%85%97%E9%85%9251%E5%B9%B4%E7%88%B6%E4%BA%B2%E6%88%92%E9%85%92"}, {"id": 28, "title": "一生只能参赛一次的世界大赛来了", "desc": "9月22日至27日，第48届世界技能大赛在中国上海举行。该赛事是全球地位最高、规模最大、影响力最广的国际性职业技能赛事，每两年举办一届。绝大多数项目的选手，在参赛当年不得超过22岁。每名选手一生只能参赛一次，赛场上不存在“个人蝉联”的情况。", "cover": "https://fyb-2.cdn.bcebos.com/hotboard_image/a12e31a72c3455aa9e44b54c3c5d9e14", "author": "", "timestamp": 0, "hot": 5125789, "url": "https://www.